  "bloques": [
    {
      "tipo": "explicacion",
      "titulo": {
        "en": "Travelling, and things going wrong"
      },
      "texto": {
        "en": "By air: **facturar** el equipaje, pass through **el control de seguridad**, wait at **la puerta de embarque** with **la tarjeta de embarque**; the plane **despega**, **hace escala** and **aterriza**. A flight **sale con retraso** or **se anula**.\n\nWhere you sleep: **un hotel**, **un hostal**, **una pensión**, **un camping** with **una tienda de campaña** and **un saco de dormir**. In high season, many **alojamientos están completos** (fully booked).\n\nKinds of trip: **un viaje organizado**, **de negocios**, **de fin de curso**; **un crucero**; **irse de puente**, to take a short trip during a long break around a public holiday. A **puente** can also mean a physical bridge.\n\nA travel story mixes the tenses: the plan in the pluperfect (**habíamos reservado**), the scene in the imperfect (**llovía**, **estaba** completo), the events in the indefinido (**perdimos** el vuelo, **nos perdimos**)."
      }
    },
