        "en": "**The app cannot check this part.** For the writing, please use pen and paper. For the speaking, say it out loud and, if you can, practise with a native speaker or a teacher who can correct you.\n\n**Write (100–120 words).** Write a review of an organised trip, real or invented: itinerary, guide, hotels, what was best and worst.\n\n**Speak (about 2 minutes).** Argue aloud for travelling in a group or travelling on your own."
